{
  "source": "..\\api\\zip.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "压缩文件 (Zip)",
      "name": "压缩文件_(zip)",
      "desc": "<p>zip 模块用于创建, 打开, 修改和解压 ZIP 文件.</p>\n<p>此模块自 AutoJs6 6.7.0 起提供, 底层使用 Zip4j. <code>zip</code> 与 <code>$zip</code> 指向同一个可调用模块对象.</p>\n<p>AutoJs6 6.8.0 的 zip 模块仍为内置功能, 不需要安装外置插件.</p>\n<p>本页中的文件系统相对路径均按当前脚本工作目录解析.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">zip</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] zip",
          "name": "[@]_zip",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "zip(zipPath)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "zip",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>zipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - ZIP 文件路径</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipfilehandle\">ZipFileHandle</a> } - ZIP 操作对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开一个 ZIP 文件操作对象.</p>\n<p>此调用与 <code>zip.open(zipPath)</code> 等价.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let archive = zip(&#39;./backup.zip&#39;);\nconsole.log(archive.path);\nconsole.log(archive.isValidZipFile());\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "zipPath"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] zip"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] open",
          "name": "[m]_open",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "open(zipPath, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "open",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>zipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - ZIP 文件路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ options = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"#zipopenoptions\">ZipOpenOptions</a> } - 压缩和解压选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipfilehandle\">ZipFileHandle</a> } - ZIP 操作对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开一个 ZIP 文件操作对象.</p>\n<p>此方法只创建操作对象. 可通过返回对象继续添加, 删除或解压成员.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "zipPath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] open"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] zipFile",
          "name": "[m]_zipfile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "zipFile(filePath, destZipPath, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "zipFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/3</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>filePath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 待压缩文件路径</li>\n<li><strong>destZipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#undefined\">undefined</a> } - 目标 ZIP 路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ options = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"#zipoptions\">ZipOptions</a> } - 压缩选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipfilehandle\">ZipFileHandle</a> } - 已完成添加操作的 ZIP 对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将一个文件添加到 ZIP 文件.</p>\n<p><code>destZipPath</code> 为 <code>null</code> 或 <code>undefined</code> 时, 目标文件名为源文件名去除扩展名后添加 <code>.zip</code>, 并位于当前脚本工作目录.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "filePath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "destZipPath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "zipFile(filePath, options)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "zipFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload 3/3</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>filePath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 待压缩文件路径</li>\n<li><strong>options</strong> { <a href=\"#zipoptions\">ZipOptions</a> } - 压缩选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipfilehandle\">ZipFileHandle</a> } - 已完成添加操作的 ZIP 对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将一个文件添加到自动命名的 ZIP 文件.</p>\n<p>目标文件名为源文件名去除扩展名后添加 <code>.zip</code>, 并位于当前脚本工作目录.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let archive = zip.zipFile(&#39;./reports/today.txt&#39;, {\n    compressionLevel: &#39;MAXIMUM&#39;,\n});\n\nconsole.log(archive.path);\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "filePath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] zipFile"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] zipDir",
          "name": "[m]_zipdir",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "zipDir(dirPath, destZipPath, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "zipDir",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload [1-2]/3</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>dirPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 待压缩目录路径</li>\n<li><strong>destZipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#undefined\">undefined</a> } - 目标 ZIP 路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ options = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"#zipoptions\">ZipOptions</a> } - 压缩选项</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipfilehandle\">ZipFileHandle</a> } - 已完成目录压缩操作的 ZIP 对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将目录压缩为 ZIP 文件.</p>\n<p><code>destZipPath</code> 为 <code>null</code> 或 <code>undefined</code> 时, 目标文件名为源目录名去除扩展名后添加 <code>.zip</code>, 并位于当前脚本工作目录.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
